abirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-one?ActivOneVytl=activ-one-vytl&utm_source=website&utm_medium=masthead&utm_campaign=website_masthead)\n    - [Super Health Plus Top UpMax ProtectionUp to Rs. 95\\* lakh coverage with an affordable premium\u20b9962\\*/annumView Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/super-health-topup)\n\n\\*Starting Plan price mentioned on the website are for self customer with age 30 and Sum Insured 5 LAKH.\n\n#5% discount from 4th policy year to 7th policy year. 10% discount from 8th policy onwards, will be available at renewal.\n\n\\*\\*Plan price mentioned are for self customer with age 25 and Sum Insured 5Lakhs.\n  - Travel Insurance Plans\n    - [Activ Travel \u2013 Student PlanLong-stay protection for students studying abroad with medical, travel and academic supportStarting from \u20b9924\\*View Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-travel)\n    - [Activ Travel \u2013 Asia PlanAffordable and focused travel cover for trips across Asia.Starting from \u20b9524\\*View Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-travel)\n    - [Activ Travel \u2013 Leisure PlanComprehensive protection for international holidays and family travel.Starting from \u20b9600\\*View Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-travel)\n    - [Activ Travel \u2013 Senior PlanTravel confidently with medical-first protection designed for senior travellers.Starting from \u20b91,958\\*View Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-travel)\n    - [Activ Travel \u2013 Annual Multi-Trip PlanOne policy for multiple international trips across the year.Starting from \u20b97,531\\*View Details](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/activ-travel)\n\n\\*Starting plan price mentioned on the website are for self customer with minimum age of 18 years.\n  - Large payout plans\n    - [Personal AccidentHealth insurance for cover against accidents\u20b9212\\*/